        "summary": "Modified this existing endpoint",
        "description": "## Description changed  \n| <div style=\"width:400px\">Updated Value</div> | <div style=\"width:400px\">Previous Value</div> |  \n| :--- | :--- |  \n| <div style=\"width:400px\">Creates a single benefit program instance with the specified data. <br/>In the request body, specify at least these required fields: url, startDate, endDate, description, title, urlAlias, and programPartner<br/><b>Secured by:</b> Manage: Benefit Program Software Partner<br/><b>Scope:</b> Benefits<br/></div> | <div style=\"width:400px\">Creates a single benefit program instance with the specified data. <br/>In the request body, specify at least these required fields: url, startDate, endDate, description, title, urlAlias, and programPartner<br/></div> |  \n\n## Security changed  \n| <div style=\"width:800px\">Updated Value</div> |  \n| :--- |  \n| <div style=\"width:800px\"></div> |  \n\n| <div style=\"width:400px\">Added Domains</div> | <div style=\"width:400px\">Removed Domains</div> |  \n| :--- | :--- |  \n| <div style=\"width:400px\">None</div> | <div style=\"width:400px\">Manage: Benefit Program Software Partner</div> |  \n\n## Scope changed  \n| <div style=\"width:800px\">Updated Value</div> |  \n| :--- |  \n| <div style=\"width:800px\"></div> |  \n\n| <div style=\"width:400px\">Added Domains</div> | <div style=\"width:400px\">Removed Domains</div> |  \n| :--- | :--- |  \n| <div style=\"width:400px\">None</div> | <div style=\"width:400px\">Benefits</div> |  \n\n <div>\n\n</div> <div style=\"color:#0067ac; background-color:#f4fcff; padding: 12px 0px 12px 12px;border-left: 5px solid #0067ac;\"> \n <b style=\"color:#0067ac\">View this Endpoint: </b>  <a href=\"#benefitPartner/v1/post-/programs\"> POST /programs</a>\n </div> \n <br>"
      }
    },
